+// swift-tools-version: 6.0
+// AUTO-SCAFFOLDED by react-native spm scaffold — safe to edit & commit via patch-package.
+// AUTO-SCAFFOLDED-VERSION: 20
+// Cache slot: 0.88.1/dual-flavor
